SUMMARY:Hot Singles in Your Area (Are Having an Existential Crisis)
LOCATION:Edinburgh
DESCRIPTION:When is an elective lobotomy actually the ultimate feminist sta
 tement? Do all over-sexed gay men ultimately aspire to the priesthood? And\
 , have you heard the one about the 89-year-old man with commitment issues? 
 Join two of London’s smartest\, silliest and most despairing new stand-up
 s for an hour of razor-sharp jokes and existential crisis. Eastern European
 \, feminist\, Irish Catholic and gay influences collide in a world of horny
  widows\, bougie priests\, and sexy communists. If only dating was this muc
 h fun.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/event/hot-singles-i
 n-your-area-are-having-an-existential-crisis/
